WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.390
Shipments: search and manage shipments: status, labels, tracking, cash on delivery and proof of delivery.

2
00:00:09.938 --> 00:00:14.690
Click "New shipment"; leave the price empty to use the rate cards.

3
00:00:15.235 --> 00:00:19.020
Print the "Labels" and record a "New status" at each stage.

4
00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:26.400
On delivery, record the "Proof of delivery" (receiver's name and photo) and click "Mark delivered".

5
00:00:26.953 --> 00:00:33.290
For international shipments, get customs documents early with "Ask the customer for documents".
